SUMMARY:Apricot Sky Productions Presents 'Tributes: A Night of One-Acts and Monologues'
DESCRIPTION:Apricot Sky Productions presents “Tributes\,” two nights of new one-act plays and monologues by New Jerseyans\, benefiting the National September 11 Memorial & Museum \nTwenty-five years after the attacks that reshaped this state\, Apricot Sky Productions will stage Tributes\, an evening of six short plays and three monologues\, on Friday\, September 11 and Saturday\, September 12 at 8 p.m. at the Grove Street Theater. Admission is free. A $20 donation is suggested at the door\, with all proceeds going to the National September 11 Memorial & Museum in New York City. \nThe work is written by Livingston playwright Eric Alter and performed and directed entirely by New Jersey artists\, many of whom watched that morning unfold from their own front steps. New Jersey lost roughly 700 residents on September 11\, 2001. \n“I will never forget the loss of humanity we experienced firsthand\,” Alter said. “We aren’t helpless. One thing we can do is help the survivors and the families.” \nNot every piece is set on that day. “I didn’t want to hit the audience over the head\,” Alter said. “The goal is to balance the weight with some levity.” \nThe lineup ranges from The Eleventh of September\, in which a man is pulled in two directions until he must make a defining choice\, to Spin Doctor Love\, a comedy about an aging DJ being pushed out of the booth\, to And Now I Read to You\, about a woman facing memory loss and the former student who returns to remind her what she meant to him. \nThe Grove Street Theater seats 360\, is wheelchair accessible\, and offers free parking. Reservations are encouraged at (973) 509-2350. Seating is general admission. Donations accepted in cash\, Venmo\, or Zelle only. No credit or debit cards. Recommended for ages 12 and up. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/apricot-sky-productions-presents-tributes-a-night-of-one-acts-and-monologues/
LOCATION:Grove Street Theatre\, 130 Grove Street\, Montclair\, New Jersey\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art & Culture,Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/FINAL911POSTER4.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Eric Alter":MAILTO:ApricotSkyProductions@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
