SUMMARY:Montclair Campus Open House 2026 - Fall Fête
DESCRIPTION:Join us for L’Alliance New York Open House in Montclair\, a day of exploration\, community\, and French-inspired activities for the whole family. Discover firsthand what makes L’Alliance New York unique and why thousands of children\, teens\, and adults choose us each year to learn French. \nSample our immersive teaching approach by participating in complimentary trial classes for adults and youth (ages 7–18)\, while younger children enjoy engaging workshops inspired by our à petits pas (ages 1–5) and Benjamin (ages 5–7) French language programs. Families can also enjoy a cozy French Storytime\, a screening of the beloved animated classic Le Roi et l’Oiseau\, browse hundreds of French books at our Book Sale & Book Swap\, and receive personalized guidance through free French placement tests. \nThe day concludes with a Members-Only Apéro\, where L’Alliance New York members can mingle with teachers\, staff\, and friends over a glass of wine and light refreshments. \nWhether you’re considering French classes for yourself or your child\, exploring our fully accredited French-immersion preschool\, or simply looking to connect with fellow Francophones or Francophiles\, this is the perfect opportunity to experience everything L’Alliance New York has to offer in Montclair. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/montclair-campus-open-house-2026-fall-fete/
LOCATION:L’Alliance NY-Montclair\, 17-19 Munn St\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art & Culture,Community,Kids & Families
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/montclair-open-house-main-image.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="L'Alliance NY-Montclair":MAILTO:montclair@lallianceny.org
END:VEVENT
