SUMMARY:Sales-Driven Metrics: Know What Counts
DESCRIPTION:Know what to track\, ditch what doesn’t matter\, and finally trust your marketing numbers.\nDrowning in dashboards but still not sure if your marketing is actually working? Sounds familiar. Most small business owners are tracking numbers that feel good but don’t mean much—while the metrics that actually drive growth go unnoticed. In this virtual Power Hour\, we’ll cut through the noise and get clear on:\n– Where to focus — which platforms actually deserve your time and attention (and which ones you can safely ignore)\n– Vanity metrics unmasked — the likes\, followers\, and impressions that look impressive but rarely move the needle\n– What really matters — the handful of metrics that tell you whether your marketing is generating real business results\nWalk away with a simple framework for reading your marketing data with confidence\, so you can stop guessing and start making decisions that actually grow your business.\nPerfect for small business owners who want less noise and more clarity in their marketing. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
