SUMMARY:Yoga in the Gardens at Van Vleck
DESCRIPTION:Tuesday Evenings: September 8th – October 13th.\nTime: 6:00 – 7:00 (Sept. 8 – 22)\, Please note: time adjustment for last 3 classes: 5:30 PM – 6:30 PM (Sept. 29 – Oct 13)\nInstructor: Jennifer Hondru – Celestin\nSpend a peaceful evening practicing mindful slow-flow yoga. Jennifer takes inspiration from the magnificent natural beauty of the Van Vleck Gardens to lead a class blending mindful movement\, breath\, meditation\, and a good dose of humor and fun. Our yoga community welcomes all levels from beginner to experienced yogis.\nIn case of inclement weather\, the class will be canceled and participants will be notified.\nFee: Single class: $20 Members / $25 General Public\nRegistration is required on or before the Monday prior to each class. There is no drop-in option for this class. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
