SUMMARY:A.I.M by Kyle Abraham: White Space
DESCRIPTION:White Space brings together acclaimed composers Jason Moran and Nico Muhly for a haunting score accompanying choreographer Kyle Abraham’s latest work. Featuring 11 captivating dancers\, the piece blends classical and contemporary movement with hip-hop influences\, creating a restless and thought-provoking world. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
