SUMMARY:CreativeMornings: Liz Samuel
DESCRIPTION:CreativeMornings is a free monthly breakfast lecture series for anyone who identifies as creative (yes\, that means you!). With 250+ chapters in 70 countries\, we’re thrilled to host the first & only NJ chapter in Montclair! \nThis month\, our global theme is “CURRENT” and our speaker is Liz Samuel\, a storytelling coach\, actress\, producer\, and live event host who helps people uncover\, craft\, and confidently share the stories that matter. \nCan’t wait to see you there! ✨ \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
