SUMMARY:Public Art Party
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the Montclair Art Museum’s new exhibitions and immerse yourself in the local art and music scene. Free entry to the Museum\, plus an open bar. All ages welcome. \nExplore the exhibition openings of Nadia Myre: Analog/ues and Kate Dodd: You’re Invited! with DJ April of Eighty-Six’d the Magazine\, spinning house music live on vinyl. The first 100 people get a limited-edition print\, screen printed live by artist\, Kristian Battell. \nDress up\, hang out\, and experience the galleries after hours. This is your excuse to do something fun surrounded by art! \nWhat To Expect\n– Free entry and free drinks for all ages—alcoholic and nonalcoholic options will be available. ID will be checked at the door.\n– All-vinyl dance party spinning house music\n– Live screen printing (first 100 people get a limited-edition print)\n– Food truck on site\n– Experience the Montclair Art Museum’s galleries after hours \nNo RSVP Required for This Event \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/public-art-party/
