SUMMARY:Neighborhood Center Centennial Gala
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate 100 years of care\, community\, and legacy at the Neighborhood Child & Infant Care Center’s Centennial Gala in Montclair. \nFriday\, September 18 | 6-11 PM\nBrookside Banquet Hall\, Bloomfield\, NJ 07003\n$100 per ticket (+ processing fees) until June 19\nRSVP or show your support here \nJoin alumni\, families\, and supporters for an inspiring evening honoring a century of impact\, while helping to ensure the next 100 years. Your presence supports children and families at the heart of our community. Early bird tickets are on sale until June 19! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
